---
# Formatting style for VesaBall's C++ sources.
# Based on LLVM, with overrides to match the codebase's existing
# tab-indented, Allman-brace conventions and to avoid clang-format
# re-wrapping already manually-aligned long lines.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
UseTab: Always
TabWidth: 4
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 0
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
PointerAlignment: Left
ReferenceAlignment: Middle
AccessModifierOffset: -4
AlignTrailingComments: true
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: All
KeepEmptyLinesAtTheStartOfBlocks: false
SortIncludes: false
...
